<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila Bulletin sets 25 ctvs cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Manila Bulletin sets 25 ctvs cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manila Bulletin Publishing Corp said on Wednesday its board had approved a 25 centavo cash dividend to be given to shareholders as of August 20.</p>
<p>The ex-dividend date is on August 11.</p>
<p>Manila Bulletin is a leading newspaper publishing house in the country.</p>
<p>-- manila.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
